---
import DocsLayout from '../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
---

<DocsLayout lang={lang}>
  <h1 class="font-mono text-3xl font-bold text-mono-50">Documentation</h1>
  <p class="mt-4 text-mono-400 leading-relaxed">
    Welcome to the Roamy documentation. Roamy is an open-source session runtime for accessing terminal sessions from any device. The core system is licensed under Apache 2.0.
  </p>

  <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
    <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="rounded-lg border border-mono-800 bg-mono-900/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-mono-600">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-mono-100">Getting Started</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mono-400">Build and run roamyd, connect with the web client or CLI.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/runtime" class="rounded-lg border border-mono-800 bg-mono-900/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-mono-600">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-mono-100">Runtime (roamyd)</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mono-400">Session daemon: configuration, CLI flags, TLS, authentication, and architecture.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/cli" class="rounded-lg border border-mono-800 bg-mono-900/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-mono-600">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-mono-100">CLI</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mono-400">The <code class="text-mono-200">roamy</code> command-line tool for managing sessions.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/protocol" class="rounded-lg border border-mono-800 bg-mono-900/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-mono-600">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-mono-100">Protocol</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mono-400">Protobuf wire protocol: envelope, streams, messages, and versioning.</p>
    </a>
    <a href="/docs/web-client" class="rounded-lg border border-mono-800 bg-mono-900/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-mono-600">
      <h2 class="font-mono text-lg font-medium text-mono-100">Web Client</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-mono-400">Browser-based terminal client built with xterm.js and Protobuf.js.</p>
    </a>
  </div>

  <h2 class="mt-16 font-mono text-xl font-bold text-mono-100">Open Source Repositories</h2>
  <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-mono-400">
    <p><a href="https://github.com/RoamyDev/roamy-protocol" class="text-mono-200 underline hover:text-mono-50">roamy-protocol</a> &mdash; Protobuf wire protocol definitions</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/RoamyDev/roamy-runtime" class="text-mono-200 underline hover:text-mono-50">roamy-runtime</a> &mdash; Session daemon, core runtime, and CLI</p>
    <p><a href="https://github.com/RoamyDev/roamy-web" class="text-mono-200 underline hover:text-mono-50">roamy-web</a> &mdash; Browser terminal client</p>
  </div>
</DocsLayout>
